    {
      "source": "A subclass of <code>WebFluxConfigurationSupport</code> that detects and delegates\nto all beans of type <a href=\"WebFluxConfigurer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.reactive.config\"><code>WebFluxConfigurer</code></a> allowing them to customize the\nconfiguration provided by <code>WebFluxConfigurationSupport</code>. This is the\nclass actually imported by <a href=\"EnableWebFlux.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.web.reactive.config\"><code>@EnableWebFlux</code></a>.",
      "translation": "`WebFluxConfigurationSupport` 的子类，用于检测并委托给所有类型为<a href=\"WebFluxConfigurer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.reactive.config\"><code>WebFluxConfigurer</code></a>的 Bean，允许它们自定义由<code>WebFluxConfigurationSupport</code>提供的配置。这是实际被<a href=\"EnableWebFlux.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.web.reactive.config\"><code>@EnableWebFlux</code></a>导入的类。",
      "count": 2
    },
